      "side": 1,
      "message": "Comment from previous review:\nI assume that this new mechanism to access the SIM phonebook would be optional, even for devices that implement the correct IRadio interface.\nBasically, I assume that Android would do:\n - use this feature if supported\n - fallback to SIM_IO if not supported.\nHow is Android expected to find out if the feature is supported or not\n\n\nYou mentioned that you have defined the feature configration in fw/base.\n\nI think we should document it here, indicating that this is optional. Something like this:\nThe support of this message by the radio is optional.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 35,
        "startChar": 11,
